        <p class="fs-5 lh-lg text-secondary">
            Hi, I'm <strong>Arciaga, Lloyd Nathaniel T.</strong>, a 21-year-old college student who
            appreciates the simple things in life, including a classic color palette
            of grey and black. My educational journey has been a unique adventure,
            beginning with my graduation from Tunasan Annex High School and I also have a 
